   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Lost Sailor** (1 review): Reviewer singles out this song as a favorite on the recording [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **New Minglewood Blues**: rare: 14 archived performances [7]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **dco2017-05-28.akg468** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 157 min; rated 4.6/5 by 5 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer doesn't notice the frequency or phasing problem on Bobby's guitar early on, and would like Oteil louder in the mix; Wind causes phasing in the drums, mostly cymbals; Bobby's guitar also phases, adding swirl to high frequencies, but is masked on louder songs [2][3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer attended the show in person and found it special; the recording was shared quickly afterward [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **dco2017-05-28.akg468**: taped by jbanyai97; source: AKG ck8|a60m|c460b > Tascam DR-70d (24bit/44.1khz) [1]",
